        "getTokenTransferProxy()": {
          "notice": "Returns the address of the TokenTransferProxy contract In version 6 of the Augustus protocol, the TokenTransferProxy contract is deprecated. The Diamond contract now directly handles token approvals. However, for backward compatibility and to support integrations that still use getTokenTransferProxy() for obtaining the TokenTransferProxy contract address, this method remains operational. It facilitates smoother migration to the updated protocol design."
